@startuml
title Post-Review Phase Activity Diagram
|System|
start
:Generate Checklist based on Paper Type;

|Author or Coordinator|
:Fill out Conference Checklist;
note right: e.g., formatting, camera-ready\nrequirements, ethics forms.

:Run AI Review;
note right: Can only be run after \nHuman Review concludes.

fork
  |AI Review Engine|
  :Analyze Paper Content;
  :Generate Draft Review Feedback;

  |System|
  fork
    :Validate AI Output (Guardrails);
    note right: No fabricated references.\nMust include verifiable metadata.
  fork again
    :Check for duplicate references;
    note right: Ensure suggested citations\nare not already in the paper.
  end fork
  
  if (Previous AI Review Exists?) then (Yes)
    :Archive previous version;
    :Save as new version (vX+1);
  else (No)
    :Save AI Review as Finalized Feedback (v1);
  endif

fork again
  |AI Review Engine|
  :Review unfilled Checklist items;
  :Attempt to fill missing items via AI;
  
  |System|
  :Verify Conference Checklist is 100% Filled;
  :Mark Checklist Verification Complete;
end fork

|Author or Coordinator|
:View AI Output & Status;
stop
@enduml
